<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan BSPA to tender Tues for 54,000T US soybeans.</title>
<headline>Taiwan BSPA to tender Tues for 54,000T US soybeans.</headline>
<text>
<p>TAIPEI, Jan 27 (REUTER) - The Taichung division of the Taiwan Breakfast Soybean Procurement Association will tender for 54,000 tonnes of U.S. soybeans on Tuesday, local traders said.</p>
<p>The shipment will be slated for delivery on March 1-15 from the U.S. Gulf of Mexico or March 16-31 from the Pacific Northwest.</p>
</text>
